      "locked": false,
      "text": "JDBC-Java DataBase Connectivity\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JDBC-Java DataBase Connectivity\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "KGqSCRV0NxCE3LVA4MIcx",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 589.5286865234375,
      "y": 183.357177734375,
      "width": 794.6569213867189,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1496895522,
      "version": 163,
      "versionNonce": 832062882,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762085706010,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What is JDBC?\nJDBC (Java Database Connectivity) is a Java API that enables Java\napplications to interact with databases. It provides methods to query\nand update data in a database.\n\n\nSimple Explanation:\nThink of JDBC as a bridge or translator between your Java application\nand your database (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, etc.).\n\nJava Application  ←→  JDBC API  ←→  Database Driver  ←→  Database\n   (Your Code)      (Standard)     (MySQL/Oracle)      (MySQL/Oracle)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What is JDBC?\nJDBC (Java Database Connectivity) is a Java API that enables Java applications to interact with databases. It provides methods to query and update data in a database.\n\n\nSimple Explanation:\nThink of JDBC as a bridge or translator between your Java application and your database (MySQL, PostgreSQL, Oracle, etc.).\n\nJava Application  ←→  JDBC API  ←→  Database Driver  ←→  Database\n   (Your Code)      (Standard)     (MySQL/Oracle)      (MySQL/Oracle)",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "bqd5W7U3VjwRQaj2WffdI",
