    {
      "id": "V6GtDHdibn3P6lElk_cW5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 587.8859558105469,
      "y": 1713.071533203125,
      "width": 802.2285156249999,
      "height": 600,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 415371106,
      "version": 108,
      "versionNonce": 1246313150,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762085839009,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "JDBC Components\n1. DriverManager\n\nManages database drivers\nEstablishes connection to database\n\n2. Connection\n\nRepresents a connection to the database\nUsed to create statements\n\n3. Statement\n\nExecutes SQL queries\nThree types: Statement, PreparedStatement, CallableStatement\n\n4. ResultSet\n\nHolds data retrieved from database\nActs like a cursor pointing to rows\n\n5. SQLException\n\nHandles database errors",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "JDBC Components\n1. DriverManager\n\nManages database drivers\nEstablishes connection to database\n\n2. Connection\n\nRepresents a connection to the database\nUsed to create statements\n\n3. Statement\n\nExecutes SQL queries\nThree types: Statement, PreparedStatement, CallableStatement\n\n4. ResultSet\n\nHolds data retrieved from database\nActs like a cursor pointing to rows\n\n5. SQLException\n\nHandles database errors",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "POIVYc9IPKl_Y8Qo5VZ1e",
