    {
      "id": "6hyOlVx62TOu8dYD14rBO",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 568.0001220703125,
      "y": 3261.9285888671875,
      "width": 704,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFU",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 305815074,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 1866904510,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086003702,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "What You Actually Need (The Library/Driver):\nTo actually connect to a database, you need a JDBC Driver - this\nIS a library:",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "What You Actually Need (The Library/Driver):\nTo actually connect to a database, you need a JDBC Driver - this IS a library:",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "w4FoHskkEFXB0-7J2M17-",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 586.2897338867188,
      "y": 3356.1429443359375,
      "width": 703.9921875,
      "height": 480,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1472335522,
      "version": 76,
      "versionNonce": 1695885182,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086019748,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "<!-- This is the actual LIBRARY you download -->\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.mysql</groupId>\n    <artifactId>mysql-connector-j</artifactId>\n    <version>8.2.0</version>\n</dependency>\n```\n\n## The Relationship:\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│  JDBC API (Specification)       │  ← Part of Java (interfaces)\n│  java.sql.Connection            │\n│  java.sql.Statement             │\n└────────────┬────────────────────┘\n             │\n             │ implements\n             ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│  JDBC Driver (Implementation)   │  ← External Library you download\n│  mysql-connector-j              │     (MySQL implementation)\n│  postgresql driver              │     (PostgreSQL implementation)\n│  oracle driver                  │     (Oracle implementation)\n└─────────────────────────────────┘",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "<!-- This is the actual LIBRARY you download -->\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>com.mysql</groupId>\n    <artifactId>mysql-connector-j</artifactId>\n    <version>8.2.0</version>\n</dependency>\n```\n\n## The Relationship:\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│  JDBC API (Specification)       │  ← Part of Java (interfaces)\n│  java.sql.Connection            │\n│  java.sql.Statement             │\n└────────────┬────────────────────┘\n             │\n             │ implements\n             ↓\n┌─────────────────────────────────┐\n│  JDBC Driver (Implementation)   │  ← External Library you download\n│  mysql-connector-j              │     (MySQL implementation)\n│  postgresql driver              │     (PostgreSQL implementation)\n│  oracle driver                  │     (Oracle implementation)\n└─────────────────────────────────┘",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hUJqMvMXwaTZPgNhOx1s4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 571.0290222167969,
      "y": 3870.2857971191406,
      "width": 624.7991333007812,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1465809022,
      "version": 61,
      "versionNonce": 2077329250,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086037965,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Analogy:\nThink of it like USB:\n\nUSB = Standard (specification) - everyone agrees on the rules\nUSB devices = Actual implementations (mouse, keyboard, flash drive)\n\nSimilarly:\n\nJDBC = Standard API (specification) - defines the rules\nMySQL Connector, PostgreSQL Driver = Actual implementations (libraries)\n\nWhy This Design?\nThis allows you to write code once:\njavaConnection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, pass);\n// ↑ This same code works with ANY database!\nJust change the driver library and connection string:\n\nMySQL: jdbc:mysql://... + mysql-connector\nPostgreSQL: jdbc:postgresql://... + postgresql driver\nOracle: jdbc:oracle:... + oracle driver\n\nSo to summarize:\n\nJDBC = API/Specification (built into Java)\nJDBC Driver = Library/Implementation (you download separately)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Analogy:\nThink of it like USB:\n\nUSB = Standard (specification) - everyone agrees on the rules\nUSB devices = Actual implementations (mouse, keyboard, flash drive)\n\nSimilarly:\n\nJDBC = Standard API (specification) - defines the rules\nMySQL Connector, PostgreSQL Driver = Actual implementations (libraries)\n\nWhy This Design?\nThis allows you to write code once:\njavaConnection conn = DriverManager.getConnection(url, user, pass);\n// ↑ This same code works with ANY database!\nJust change the driver library and connection string:\n\nMySQL: jdbc:mysql://... + mysql-connector\nPostgreSQL: jdbc:postgresql://... + postgresql driver\nOracle: jdbc:oracle:... + oracle driver\n\nSo to summarize:\n\nJDBC = API/Specification (built into Java)\nJDBC Driver = Library/Implementation (you download separately)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Rl7Q8qHxMn8B-9Sld7QBJ",
