    {
      "id": "yZNVQFPnjGSTkV0Np3X5a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -271.48202082777186,
      "y": 17424.09702516671,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 675,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bFy",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 821546713,
      "version": 51,
      "versionNonce": 1682103159,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762612347535,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Key Hibernate Components\n1. Configuration\n\nLoads Hibernate configuration and mappings\nCreates SessionFactory\n\n2. SessionFactory\n\nHeavy-weight object (created once per application)\nThread-safe\nFactory for Session objects\n\n3. Session\n\nLight-weight object (one per request/transaction)\nNOT thread-safe\nMain interface between Java and database\nPerforms CRUD operations\n\n4. Transaction\n\nManages database transactions\nProvides rollback functionality\n\n5. Query / Criteria\n\nUsed to execute HQL or Criteria queries",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key Hibernate Components\n1. Configuration\n\nLoads Hibernate configuration and mappings\nCreates SessionFactory\n\n2. SessionFactory\n\nHeavy-weight object (created once per application)\nThread-safe\nFactory for Session objects\n\n3. Session\n\nLight-weight object (one per request/transaction)\nNOT thread-safe\nMain interface between Java and database\nPerforms CRUD operations\n\n4. Transaction\n\nManages database transactions\nProvides rollback functionality\n\n5. Query / Criteria\n\nUsed to execute HQL or Criteria queries",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
