      "originalText": "Example 2: Find with Different ID Types\njava// Long ID\nUser user = session.find(User.class, 1L);\n\n// Integer ID\nProduct product = session.find(Product.class, 123);\n\n// String ID\nOrder order = session.find(Order.class, \"ORD-2024-001\");\n\n// UUID ID\nimport java.util.UUID;\nCustomer customer = session.find(Customer.class, \n    UUID.fromString(\"123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000\"));",
