      "updated": 1763130975071,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "what are Hibernate Embeddable ,suppose we want to create \na table with column student id,name,address and for address\nwe need street,city,state,zipcode so now here we have  two seprate \nentity student itself is an entity and address has it's own property \nwhich can be taken into account as entity \n\n1.there are few way to deal with this either we club both student and entity\ninto one class ->to make a single table or\n\n2.we create two seprate table and link it with the student table",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "what are Hibernate Embeddable ,suppose we want to create \na table with column student id,name,address and for address\nwe need street,city,state,zipcode so now here we have  two seprate \nentity student itself is an entity and address has it's own property \nwhich can be taken into account as entity \n\n1.there are few way to deal with this either we club both student and entity\ninto one class ->to make a single table or\n\n2.we create two seprate table and link it with the student table",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
