    {
      "id": "iBxqxSXCnVl5BxNM_Exzk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -437.2779381276414,
      "y": 45050.824108548615,
      "width": 715,
      "height": 400,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bK3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 836577071,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 1388036705,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763131248401,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Why Use @Embeddable?\n✅ Benefits:\n\n1.Code Reusability: Reuse common structures (Address, Name, etc.)\n2.Better Organization: Group related fields together\n3.Type Safety: Use objects instead of primitive fields\n4.Single Table: No JOIN queries needed (better performance)\n5.Encapsulation: Keep related data together\n\nUse Cases:\n\nAddress (street, city, zip, country)\nName (firstName, middleName, lastName)\nDateRange (startDate, endDate)\nMoney (amount, currency)\nContact (email, phone, fax)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why Use @Embeddable?\n✅ Benefits:\n\n1.Code Reusability: Reuse common structures (Address, Name, etc.)\n2.Better Organization: Group related fields together\n3.Type Safety: Use objects instead of primitive fields\n4.Single Table: No JOIN queries needed (better performance)\n5.Encapsulation: Keep related data together\n\nUse Cases:\n\nAddress (street, city, zip, country)\nName (firstName, middleName, lastName)\nDateRange (startDate, endDate)\nMoney (amount, currency)\nContact (email, phone, fax)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LHnAtxrrDUSV57_FGXJsm",
      "type": "image",
      "x": -391.03061669911403,
      "y": 45479.49148977676,
      "width": 422.20075608969523,
      "height": 379.0405573396353,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "transparent",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
