    {
      "id": "S13KtJ9hFvdJv9wq4yZ5N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -383.9244503042361,
      "y": 47479.17689995773,
      "width": 692.9995727539062,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bK9",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 696177455,
      "version": 53,
      "versionNonce": 929478753,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763201650227,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Hibernate Table Relationships (JPA/Hibernate)\n\nHibernate supports the same relationship types as relational\ndatabases, mapped using JPA annotations.\n\nThe 4 major relationship types are:\n\n1.One-to-One\n\n2.One-to-Many\n\n3.Many-to-One\n\n4.Many-to-Many",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Hibernate Table Relationships (JPA/Hibernate)\n\nHibernate supports the same relationship types as relational databases, mapped using JPA annotations.\n\nThe 4 major relationship types are:\n\n1.One-to-One\n\n2.One-to-Many\n\n3.Many-to-One\n\n4.Many-to-Many",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
