      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "bKc",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2039806241,
      "version": 100,
      "versionNonce": 913678433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1763204068510,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "iii)Now in Main.java we need to call both object and persist in db\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Users u1=new Users();\n        u1.setUid(101);\n        u1.setAge(19);\n        u1.setUname(\"Shivansh\");\n\n        Passport p1=new Passport();\n        p1.setPassport_id(2814986);\n        p1.setCountry(\"India\");\n\n        u1.setPassport(p1);\n\n        System.out.println(u1);\n\n        Configuration cfg=new Configuration();\n        SessionFactory sf=cfg.configure().buildSessionFactory();\n        Session session=sf.openSession();\n        Transaction tr=session.beginTransaction();\n        //we need to save passport first cause passport id will be used as foreign key\n        //if we save user first then foreign key will be left empty\n\n        session.persist(p1);\n        session.persist(u1);\n\n        tr.commit();\n        session.close();\n        sf.close();\n    }\n}",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "iii)Now in Main.java we need to call both object and persist in db\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Users u1=new Users();\n        u1.setUid(101);\n        u1.setAge(19);\n        u1.setUname(\"Shivansh\");\n\n        Passport p1=new Passport();\n        p1.setPassport_id(2814986);\n        p1.setCountry(\"India\");\n\n        u1.setPassport(p1);\n\n        System.out.println(u1);\n\n        Configuration cfg=new Configuration();\n        SessionFactory sf=cfg.configure().buildSessionFactory();\n        Session session=sf.openSession();\n        Transaction tr=session.beginTransaction();\n        //we need to save passport first cause passport id will be used as foreign key\n        //if we save user first then foreign key will be left empty\n\n        session.persist(p1);\n        session.persist(u1);\n\n        tr.commit();\n        session.close();\n        sf.close();\n    }\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
