      "text": "Here since we have Departments Table with Employee column\nmarked as OneToMany Department table says hey in one \ndepartment we can have many employee (one to many) that\nis if employee repeat i will have to repeat department\nalso and deptId should be unique in my table so let me \ndo one thing create a seprate table where dept and emplyee\nboth can repeat\n",
