      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "although we needed only 3 table but \ngot 4 table that is because in both class\nwe specified many to many mapping and in both \ncase both table primary key will repeat cause \nmemeber will have multiple society and society\nwill have multiple member\n\nin this case \n1.members_socities-->is created by Members.java\n2.socities_members-->is created by Societies.java",
